              "meaning": "name · nama",
              "emoji": "📛",
              "note": "namae"
            },
            {
              "id": "ja-u1-l2-s3",
              "kind": "card",
              "text": "New word · Perkataan baharu",
              "word": "はじめまして",
              "meaning": "Nice to meet you · Selamat berkenalan",
              "emoji": "🤝",
              "note": "hajimemashite · say it when you meet someone for the first time"
            },
            {
              "id": "ja-u1-l2-s4",
              "kind": "build",
              "text": "Build the sentence. · Bina ayat.",
              "prompt": "I am Aina. · Saya Aina.",
              "tiles": [
                "わたしは",
                "アイナ",
                "です",
                "ありがとう"
              ],
              "answer": [
                "わたしは",
                "アイナ",
                "です"
              ],
              "explanation": "わたしは アイナ です (watashi wa Aina desu). Here は is read \"wa\"."
            },
            {
              "id": "ja-u1-l2-s5",
              "kind": "gap",
              "text": "Fill the gap. · Isi tempat kosong.",
              "sentence": "はじめまして。わたしは アイナ ___。",
              "options": [
                {
                  "id": "a",
                  "text": "です"
                },
                {
                  "id": "b",
                  "text": "さようなら"
                },
                {
                  "id": "c",
                  "text": "おはよう"
                }
              ],
              "answer": "a",
              "explanation": "です (desu) ends a polite sentence: わたしは アイナ です."
            },
            {
              "id": "ja-u1-l2-s6",
              "kind": "pick",
              "text": "Pick the meaning. · Pilih maksudnya.",
              "prompt": "What does はじめまして mean?",
              "options": [
                {
                  "id": "a",
                  "text": "Nice to meet you"
